["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>The CZ is already accurate. Spend on what makes you hit: glass you can see through, a sling you will use, and ammo it likes.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 338\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Upgrade order for the CZ 457, cheapest wins first: 1 an ammunition test with 3 or 4 kinds; 2 a rimfire scope and 11 mm rings, from about 260 dollars; 3 a sling on the factory swivels, 30 to 45 dollars; 4 a spare 10 round magazine, 16 to 80 dollars; 5 a hard case and lock for transport and storage, price to be checked. Canadian prices, entry tier, checked 2026-10-23.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"338\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Upgrade in this order</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"372\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"66\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Ammo test</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">3 or 4 kinds, a box each</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Tip</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"96\" width=\"372\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"118\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Scope and rings</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Rimfire scope, 11 mm rings</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">$260+</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"148\" width=\"372\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"170\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Sling</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">On the factory swivels</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">$30 to $45</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"200\" width=\"372\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"222\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"219\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Spare magazine</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">10 round steel or polymer</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">$16 to $80</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"252\" width=\"372\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"274\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">5</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"271\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Hard case, lock</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Transport and storage law</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">VERIFY</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Prices CAD, entry tier, checked 2026-10-23 (65%).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Cheapest wins first: an ammo test (Tip).</li><li>Then a scope and rings, a sling, a spare magazine (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why this order</summary><ul><li>.22 accuracy changes a lot between ammo brands in the same rifle (Tip). How to test: <a href=\"#/s/rimfire-22\">the .22 rimfire</a>.</li><li>Most of your grouse and practice shots are under 50 m; a modest rimfire scope does the job (Tip).</li><li>A hard case and a lock help you meet the transport and storage rules (99% for the rules, via <a href=\"#/s/firearm-care\">firearm care</a>). Prices: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>.</li><li>Prices are Canadian dollars, from Canadian store listings found 2026-10-23 (65%, search previews). They change weekly.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Example</th><th>Price CAD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Entry</td><td>Vortex Crossfire II 2 to 7x32 Rimfire</td><td>$199.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Mid</td><td>Leupold VX Freedom Rimfire 3 to 9x40</td><td>$495 to $700 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Premium</td><td>Zeiss Conquest V4 3 to 12x44</td><td>$1,199.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Price checked 2026-10-23.</li><li>Rimfire scopes are set for short range parallax (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: scope notes</summary><ul><li>Entry: Cabela's Canada $199.99; Rangeview Sports $219.99 (65%, search previews 2026-10-23).</li><li>Mid: Canadian Tire $699.99; Rangeview Sports $495.36 special order <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Premium: Canex $1,199.99 for the 3 to 12x44 with #20 Z Plex and capped turret <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. This is a centre fire hunting scope, not a rimfire model; its parallax is set for longer range (Tip). <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> before buying for the .22.</li><li>Parallax: a scope set for 100 m can show a small aim error at 25 m if your eye is off centre (Tip). Rimfire models are usually set closer (Tip).</li><li>Tube size: all three are 1 in tubes except where the maker says 30 mm: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> so the rings match.</li><li>How to pick power, glass and eye relief: <a href=\"#/s/optics-mastery\">optics mastery</a>, <a href=\"#/s/scope-guide\">choose a scope</a>.</li><li>My lean: the entry scope, unless you plan to shoot past 75 m a lot.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cross section through the CZ 457 receiver from the back. 1 the scope ring jaws clamp onto 2 the 11 mm dovetail grooves cut into the top of the receiver. 3 the bolt runs inside. CZ also allows a Weaver rail.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">The 11 mm dovetail, end view</text><path d=\"M110 250 L110 150 Q110 120 140 112 L260 112 Q290 120 290 150 L290 250 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><path d=\"M150 112 L142 96 L258 96 L250 112 Z\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><path d=\"M124 96 L142 96 L150 112 L136 120 L118 104 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M276 96 L258 96 L250 112 L264 120 L282 104 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M118 104 L118 70 Q200 40 282 70 L282 104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">11 mm</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"104\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"284\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"200\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"277\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Ring clamp jaws</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"301\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Dovetail grooves on the receiver</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"325\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bolt inside the receiver</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Weaver rail is the other option (CZ).</text></svg>\n</figure><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Example</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Entry</td><td>Budget 11 mm rimfire rings</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> in CAD</td></tr><tr><td>Mid</td><td>Warne 722M rimfire, 1 in, high</td><td>US$45.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Premium</td><td>Talley 11 mm dovetail rimfire, 1 in</td><td>$59.77 CAD <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: ring notes</summary><ul><li>Talley 11 mm dovetail rimfire rings at Cabela's Canada: $59.77 (65%, search preview 2026-10-23).</li><li>Warne 722M: US$45.99 on the maker's site; fits 3/8 in and 11 mm dovetails (60%, US price).</li><li>CZ makes its own 457 and 455 rings, 1 in and 30 mm, 0.575 in high (65%, US retailer listings). CAD price: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>.</li><li>Ring height: low enough that your cheek rests on the stock, high enough that the bell clears the barrel (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Example</th><th>Price CAD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sling</td><td>Butler Creek Alaskan Magnum</td><td>$29.77 sale, $44.99 list <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Spare magazine, polymer</td><td>CZ .22 LR, 5 or 10</td><td>$15.99 to $52.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Spare magazine, steel</td><td>CZ .22 LR, 10</td><td>$69.99 to $79.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Snap caps, .22 LR</td><td>Tipton or A Zoom</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> in CAD</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Price checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: notes</summary><ul><li>Sling: the swivel holders are parts 75 and 76 in the CZ parts list; which type your model has differs by model (95%, CZ manual page 12, parts marked as model dependent). Check yours before buying swivels (Tip).</li><li>Sling mid and premium tiers: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> at your shop.</li><li>Magazines: Rangeview Sports lists both, ranges cover the 5 and 10 round sizes <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Buy CZ made magazines for your calibre (Tip).</li><li>A 10 round .22 LR magazine is legal for your bolt action rimfire (95%, chapter 3).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Legal to add to a CZ 457: scope, rings or a Weaver rail, a sling and swivels, spare CZ magazines, a muzzle brake or thread cap, a new stock that is not a bullpup, and factory CZ barrel kits. Not legal: a suppressor, a bullpup stock, auto or bump fire parts, a barrel cut under 457 mm, and thermal or night optics on a BC hunt.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"350\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Legal and not legal</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Legal to add</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Not legal</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"66\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Scope, rings, Weaver rail</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"102\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Sling and swivels</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"138\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Spare CZ magazines</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Brake or thread cap</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"210\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">New stock (not bullpup)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"246\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Factory CZ barrel kits</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"66\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Suppressor</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"102\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bullpup stock</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"138\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Auto or bump fire parts</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Cut down barrel</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"210\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Thermal or night scope*</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">* Infrared optics: illegal to have on a BC hunt.</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bullpup: a stock that puts the action behind</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">the trigger (SOR/98-462).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Suppressor: a prohibited device in Canada <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Infrared optics: banned on a BC hunt <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the law behind the list</summary><aside class=\"callout law\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Criminal Code s. 84(1), \"prohibited device\" (c)</div><p>\"a device or contrivance designed or intended to muffle or stop the sound or report of a firearm\"</p></aside><ul><li>So no suppressor, ever, even on a threaded CZ <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>A thread protector or muzzle brake on a threaded model is not a sound suppressor (90%, my reading). Never one that muffles the sound.</li><li>Bullpup stock: a prohibited device (99%, SOR/98-462 Part 4 s. 2). Ordinary replacement stocks and chassis that keep the action ahead of the trigger: no such rule found (85%, my reading). Ask a gunsmith.</li><li>Barrel under 457 mm by alteration, or auto fire: prohibited (99%, chapter 9).</li><li>Infrared optics: \"To use or possess infrared optics on a hunting expedition\" is unlawful (99%, synopsis page 11, item 39).</li><li>Lights to hunt by: unlawful (99%, item 38).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Upgrade</th><th>Why skip it now (Tip)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Aftermarket trigger</td><td>The CZ trigger already adjusts (95% that it adjusts)</td></tr><tr><td>Bigger than 12x scope</td><td>Under 75 m you will not use it</td></tr><tr><td>Heavy chassis</td><td>Weight you carry all day for grouse</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>All Tips: your call.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more</summary><ul><li>Better ammo and practice beat parts (Tip).</li><li>Any work on the trigger: gunsmith (95%, CZ page 9 caution).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 374\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CZ 457 cheat sheet: safety back with the white dot showing is on; the bolt opens with the safety on; the magazine catch is in front of the magazine, press it back; to unload take the magazine out, open the bolt, look and feel; zero at 50 m, dead on from 15 to 55 m; clean from the chamber, and after wet days; stock screws 3.5 newton metres; standard trigger 8 to 15 newtons; no suppressor, ever.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"374\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">CZ 457 cheat sheet</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Safety</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Back, white dot = ON</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"78\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Bolt</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Opens with safety ON</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"112\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Mag out</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Catch in front, press back</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"146\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Unload</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Mag out, bolt open, look, feel</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"180\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Zero</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">50 m, dead on 15 to 55 m</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"214\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Clean</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">From the chamber, after wet days</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"248\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Stock screws</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">3.5 Nm</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"282\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Trigger</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">8 to 15 N standard</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"316\" width=\"372\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"336\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Law</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"336\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">No suppressor, ever</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">All from the CZ manual or the law (95 to 99%).</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Screenshot this (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: every chapter</summary><ol><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-01\">Parts and controls</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-02\">Safety</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-03\">Magazines, loading, unloading</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-04\">Sights, scope, zeroing</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-05\">Practice games</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-06\">Small game in BC</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-07\">Cleaning</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-08\">Bolt out, field strip, rebuild</a></li><li><a href=\"#/s/mc-cz457-09\">Barrel swap and trigger</a></li><li>Upgrades (this one)</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Legal to add to a CZ 457: scope, rings or a Weaver rail, a sling and swivels, spare CZ magazines, a muzzle brake or thread cap, a new stock that is not a bullpup, and factory CZ barrel kits. Not legal: a suppressor, a bullpup stock, auto or bump fire parts, a barrel cut under 457 mm, and thermal or night optics on a BC hunt.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"350\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Legal and not legal</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Legal to add</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Not legal</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"66\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Scope, rings, Weaver rail</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"102\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Sling and swivels</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"138\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Spare CZ magazines</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Brake or thread cap</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"210\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">New stock (not bullpup)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"246\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Factory CZ barrel kits</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"66\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Suppressor</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"102\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bullpup stock</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"138\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Auto or bump fire parts</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"174\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Cut down barrel</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"210\" width=\"188\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Thermal or night scope*</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">* Infrared optics: illegal to have on a BC hunt.</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bullpup: a stock that puts the action behind</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">the trigger (SOR/98-462).</text></svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Buy ammo before accessories, and practice before ammo.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Buying rings for a Picatinny rail. The CZ has an 11 mm dovetail unless a rail was added.</li><li>Ordering a \"can\" from a US site. Illegal to have in Canada.</li><li>A huge scope on a light .22: heavy and slow.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Before you buy: take the rifle to the shop, unloaded and cased, and fit the scope and rings on it there.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Store listings, search previews 2026-10-23 (60 to 65%). Criminal Code s. 84, SOR/98-462 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Synopsis page 11 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. CZ manual <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://cabelas.ca/product/142851/HeroBox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cabela's Canada: Vortex Crossfire II 2 to 7x32 Rimfire</a>, $199.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. <a href=\"https://www.rangeviewsports.ca/product/vortex-crossfire-ii-2-7x32-rimfire-riflescope-v-plex-moa/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rangeview Sports listing</a>, $219.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.canadiantire.ca/en/pdp/vx-freedom-rimfire-3-9x40-1-in-rimfire-moa-riflescope-3751937p.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Canadian Tire: Leupold VX Freedom Rimfire 3 to 9x40</a>, $699.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>; Rangeview special order $495.36 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.canex.ca/en/zeiss-conquest-v4-3-12x44-ea1-740035014633\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Canex: Zeiss Conquest V4 3 to 12x44</a>, $1,199.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://cabelas.ca/product/160135/HeroBox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cabela's Canada: Talley 11 mm dovetail rimfire rings</a>, $59.77 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. <a href=\"https://warnescopemounts.com/722m-warne-1-inch-rimfire-high-matte-rings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Warne 722M</a>, US$45.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://cabelas.ca/product/67016/HeroBox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cabela's Canada: Butler Creek Alaskan Magnum sling</a>, $29.77 sale, $44.99 list <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.rangeviewsports.ca/product/cz-22-lr-steel-magazine-for-457-455-452-512/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rangeview Sports: CZ .22 LR steel magazine</a> and <a href=\"https://www.rangeviewsports.ca/product/cz-22-lr-polymer-magazine-for-457-455-452-512\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">polymer magazine</a> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/C-46/section-84.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Criminal Code s. 84</a> and <a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-98-462/FullText.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SOR/98-462 Part 4</a>, current to 30 September 2026, read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Synopsis 2026 to 2028 page 11, items 38 and 39, via <a href=\"#/s/rb-legal-methods\">legal methods</a> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://czubpimstorage.blob.core.windows.net/s